#. type: Title ==
#: src/gerbview/gerbview.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to GerbView"
msgstr "Einführung in den Gerber-Betrachter"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gerbview/gerbview.adoc:49
msgid ""
"GerbView is a Gerber file (RS-274X format) and Excellon drill file viewer. Up to "
"32 files can be displayed at once."
msgstr ""
"Der Gerber-Betrachter ist ein Werkzeug zum Anzeigen von Gerber-Dateien (RS-274X-"
"Format) und Excellon-Bohrdateien. Es können bis zu 32 Dateien auf einmal "
"angezeigt werden."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gerbview/gerbview.adoc:54
msgid ""
"For more information about the Gerber file format please read http://www.ucamco."
"com/files/downloads/file/81/the_gerber_file_format_specification.pdf[the Gerber "
"File Format Specification].  Details about drill file format can be found at "
"http://web.archive.org/web/20071030075236/http://www.excellon.com/manuals/"
"program.htm[the Excellon format description]."
msgstr ""
"Weitere Informationen über das Gerber-Dateiformat finden Sie in der http://www."
"ucamco.com/files/downloads/file/81/the_gerber_file_format_specification."
"pdf[Gerber Spezifikation]. Einzelheiten zum Bohrdateiformat finden Sie unter dem "
"http://web.archive.org/web/20071030075236/http://www.excellon.com/manuals/"
"program.htm[Excellon-Format]."

